8:# Embedded in-process: pegaflow-core is the host/SSD/RDMA KV offload tier.
9-# Pinned to the upstream master rev that landed PR #395 (P-side partial-tail
10-# save + first-token router forwarding), including PR #381's metaserver flush
11-# barrier and embeddable P2pTransferService. The supported producer versions
12-# and default layouts are pinned in the P/D deployment docs; they register the
13-# same block-local bytes PegaInfer restores, so no cross-layout conversion is
14-# required.
15:# per the workflow in docs/subsystems/runtime/pegaflow-offload-integration.md
16-# §5.2. default-features=false drops its `cuda-12` (which would pull a
17-# clashing cudarc/cuda-12080 selector); the workspace cudarc already provides
18:# cuda-12090 + nvrtc + runtime, which covers pegaflow-core and
19:# pegaflow-transfer. `rdma` enables pegaflow-transfer: cross-node block fetch
20-# (RDMA READ) + MetaServer discovery — the P/D disaggregation data plane.
